2698:         # === Issue 3 fix (2026-04-21): seed a freshly-promoted bowler's
2699:         # figures to 0-0(0.0) immediately, bypassing the tracker's
2700:         # 3-frame cold-start consensus.
2701:         #
2702:         # A bowler entering `current_bowler` via the must-change path
2703:         # has just started a new over, which in limited-overs cricket
2704:         # ALWAYS means 0-0(0.0) at ball 0 of their spell.  Without
2705:         # seeding, the tracker waits 3 identical reads of "0" before
2706:         # promoting to `confirmed`, which means entry["runs"] stays
2707:         # None for 3 frames and the UI shows a blank/"—" bowler line
2708:         # for ~3-5 seconds.
