3540:     # === Innings-break deferral (2026-04-21) ===
3541:     # When innings 1 reaches 20.0 overs (or all-out), the match enters
3542:     # a 15-30 minute innings break. During the break the broadcast cycles
3543:     # through stats panels, highlights, ads — none of which contain live
3544:     # innings-2 data. Firing `execute_innings_change` immediately at
3545:     # overs=20.0 flips the UI to "DC Inn 2 — Need X from Y balls" while
3546:     # the match is still mid-break, with no innings-2 data to populate.
3547:     # Via deepMerge the UI then keeps showing innings 1's batters/scores
3548:     # stale on top of the "DC Inn 2" header, producing the nonsensical
3549:     # "DC 242/2 (20 ov)" display the user sees.
