3551:     # Fix: latch innings 1 final, set _inn_break_pending, and hold the
3552:     # UI on innings 1's finalized state until we see real innings 2
3553:     # evidence (low-overs score reading with the other team at bat).
3554:     # Deterministic all_out_10 uses the same gate (all-out also triggers
3555:     # a break). Hard timeout after _INN_BREAK_MAX_FRAMES prevents a
3556:     # permanently-stuck break if broadcast evidence never surfaces.
