3561:     # === Match-end consensus (Fix A, 2026-04-22) ===
3562:     # Require 2 consecutive scoreboard frames proposing the same
3563:     # innings-2 end reason before finalizing the match. Protects
3564:     # against single-frame OCR flickers (e.g. 8→10 wickets misread,
3565:     # score briefly rewriting above target then self-correcting).
