3574:     # === Unsupported-score-spike consensus ===
3575:     # An LLM can hallucinate a small (within-the-7-poison-threshold)
3576:     # score increase — e.g. read 44 instead of 37 — when none of the
3577:     # other strip cells move (overs unchanged, wickets unchanged,
3578:     # bowler runs unchanged, no broadcast WD/NB badge, batter runs
3579:     # unchanged).  Cricket physics says a real run-scoring event always
3580:     # moves at least one of these; an "unsupported" delta is therefore
3581:     # almost certainly a misread.  Pre-fix this poisoned `this_over`
3582:     # with a phantom `Nb+6` because the EXTRA-IMMEDIATE path in
